*notes: This is the problem, How do i know that there is used

Am chord but why not A major or Aa7 ...

If you want to solve this problem You have need to listen this song using

headphone with very carefully attention. Then you will automatically understood that is Am chord,

not A major or otherwise.

BUT BUT BUT ther have a Another way to solve this problem.

If you know that which scale is used on this song, so that is verry well.

This song is on Dm and 1 flate Scale. [ minor scale on flat table ]

Dm Scale: D E F G A Bb C D

Principle Chords of Minor or Dm Scale:

Root minor + 4th minor + 5th 7th. That means: Dm + Gm + A7

Extra chords: chords of 3rd minor/major, 5th minor/major and 7th minor/major.

That means, F/Fm, A/Am and C/Cm

But there somthings is different Chord of 4th note. that is G on this song.

This is the only for craete a sweetness music.

